Description: Assesses data quality in Observational Medical Outcomes Partnership Common Data Model (OMOP CDM) databases. Executes data quality checks and provides an R `shiny` application to view the results. This is the Miimansa fork of the OHDSI DataQualityDashboard package, which adds row-level traceability: the records that cause a check to fail can be captured and persisted to database tables.
